{
  "name": "InOut AI - 42 Complaint Follow-up",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "contract-note",
      "name": "Input Output Contract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -720,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Complaint Follow Up\n\nFinds complaints requiring follow-up, checks current status, sends customer follow-up when allowed, escalates overdue manager actions, and saves complaint events.\n\nInput: Optional complaint id, branch id, due date filter, or scheduled follow-up batch parameters.\nOutput: { success: true, processed: number, customerFollowUpSent: boolean, managerEscalated: boolean }\n\nShared Input Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"correlationId\": \"\",\n  \"messageId\": \"\",\n  \"conversationId\": \"\",\n  \"customerId\": \"\",\n  \"customerPhone\": \"\",\n  \"detectedLanguage\": \"\",\n  \"intent\": \"\",\n  \"payload\": {}\n}\n```\n\nShared Output Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"data\": {},\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"correlationId\": \"\",\n    \"workflow\": \"\",\n    \"durationMs\": 0\n  }\n}\n```\n\nRequired fields:\n- correlationId\n- workflowExecutionId\n- idempotencyKey when writing\n\nRules:\n- Use liability-safe follow-up wording and do not close complaints automatically.\n- Send one WhatsApp message per recipient only.\n- Use templates outside the 24-hour customer care window when backend policy requires it.\n- Escalate P1/P2 or SLA-missed complaints to the responsible manager."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workflow-input",
      "name": "Workflow Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "find-complaints-requiring-follow-up",
      "name": "Find Complaints Requiring Follow-up",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -760,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{($('Workflow Config').first().json.SERVICE_API_BASE_URL || 'MISSING_SERVICE_API_BASE_URL').replace(/\\/$/, '').replace(/\\/api\\/v1$/i, '') + '/api/v1/complaints/follow-up-due?limit=' + encodeURIComponent($json.limit || 25) + '&branchId=' + encodeURIComponent($json.branchId || '')'}}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{'Bearer ' + ($('Workflow Config').first().json.N8N_API_KEY || '')}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Correlation-Id",
              "value": "={{$json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{($json.idempotencyKey || $json.idempotency_key || $json.wamid || $json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id || $execution.id)}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": false,
        "contentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{$json}}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      }
    },
